  "content": "<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1065199/description_9f17e9b5-a8db-4f5f-a578-f81dd0d88123.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"134\"><br><br><a href=\"https://discord.gg/Kb9SmGCxBv\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1197917238091579572?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;label=Discord&amp;link=https://discord.gg/F3YxQBRX3P\" alt=\"Discord\" width=\"\" height=\"\"></a></strong></span></h1><h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1065199/description_fb8234ce-4aa7-492d-b0f5-04d9d519dbc7.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"308\"></h3><p>&nbsp;</p><hr><h3 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h3><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Этот мод представляет собой предметы Hookshot и Longshot из мода <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/zelda-legend-of-the-master-sword\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Zelda, Legend of the Master Sword</a></strong></h2><p>&nbsp;</p><hr><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Zelda_Legend_of_the_Master_Sword/BH_ZLotMS_spoilers.webp\" alt=\"ZLotMS-spoiler\" width=\"5834\" height=\"625\"></p><h3><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Как получить Hookshot<br><br></span></strong></h3><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>Куплен у Бродячего Торговца</p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><h3><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Рецепт крафта Longshot<br><br></span></strong></h3><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1065199/description_e7192b19-4b87-40d5-a3bf-db02e366912f.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"250\" height=\"125\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><h4 style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fmezimods\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">&nbsp;</a></h4><hr><p><img src=\"https://www.bisectho